Reading through the candidate file to trace each system's wiring before scoring.

**Worksheet**

F1: state=`game` obj; PRNG `nextRand(state)` used everywhere (terrain, events, storm, benchmark), no Math.random found; `endTurn`→`beginTurnPart1`/`finishTurnPart2` resolve fixed order (storm→production→upkeep→morale→skill→strikes→events→trade→turn++). Score 2.

F2: 8x8 grid loop; terrain via `pick(s, weightsTable)` seeded; `canBuild` checks `def.terrain.includes(tile.terrain)`; `adjBonus` read in `buildingYieldMultiplier` via `neighbors()`, changes `adjMult`. Score 2.

F3: greenhouse ash+water→food, forge ore+power→metal, workshop metal→parts; `addResourceWithOverflowLog` enforces caps and logs loss. Score 2.

F4: colonists have skill/fatigue/morale/job/assignedBuildingId; all three read in `buildingYieldMultiplier` (skillMult, moraleMult, fatigueMult). Score 2.

F5: `resolveUpkeep` consumes food/water; `resolveMoraleFatigue` reduces morale on shortage; morale feeds `moraleMult`; recovery via rest (+3 surplus, fatigue decay, strike→active at morale>=30). Score 2.

F6: 10 nodes r1-r10; `purchaseResearch` enforces `node.prereq.every`, deducts cost, calls `node.effect(s)` which writes `researchEffects` read in `buildingYieldMultiplier`/`buildingUnlocked`. Score 2.

F7: 11 events in `EVENTS`; `rollEvent` does weighted cumulative selection; 5 choice events (festival/raid/ruins/fungus/dispute) each with distinct `apply*` state mutations; `eventCooldowns` + `weightedEligibleEvents` gate refire. Score 2.

F8: `tradePrice` reads stockRatio & `market.demand`; `generateCaravanInventory` limits qty, decremented in `caravanSell`/`caravanBuy`, both wired to UI buttons. Score 2.

F9: `resolveStorm` fires on `turn % interval`, severity grows with `turn*0.004`; `b.damaged` zeroes output in `buildingYieldMultiplier`; `stormwall`/research (`stormMult`) reduce severity; `repairBuilding` costs 5 parts, clears flag. Score 2.

F10: `serializeState`→JSON to textarea; `loadFromText` parses, `validateStateShape` checks fields, error shown in `#loadErr`. Score 2.

F11: `checkEndConditions` — pop==0 collapse, turn>=60 win/timeout; `computeScore` combines pop/research/turn/stock; `renderEndScreen` shows summary. Score 2.

F12: tab click listener + `ui.tab`; log lines `[T${e.turn}]`; `RES_TOOLTIP`/`buildTooltip`/tile tooltips; keydown handles Space + digit keys; one `@media(max-width:700px)` rule plus flex-wrap layout. Score 2.

F13: 17 non-trivial assertions (prereq enforcement, repair cost, cooldown, RNG determinism, save/load hash roundtrip); `runBenchmark`/`greedyPolicyTurn` run headless, `runBenchmarkReport` prints `stateHash`. Score 2.

G1: `r1.effect` sets `researchEffects.greenhouseMult`, read in `buildingYieldMultiplier` per building type every turn. Score 4.

G2: `resolveUpkeep` sets shortages→`resolveMoraleFatigue` subtracts morale→`moraleMult` in `buildingYieldMultiplier` every turn. Score 4.

G3: `resolveStorm` sets `b.damaged`→`buildingYieldMultiplier` zeroes output→`repairBuilding` spends parts, clears flag, restores formula. Score 4.

G4: `tradePrice` reads `s.resources[res]/cap` and `s.market.demand[res]`, demand drifts every `finishTurnPart2`. Score 4.

G5: `apFestivalYes`(food/water/morale), `apRaidPay`(scrip), `apRuinsCareful`(parts/scrip), `apDisputeSenior`(skillXP/morale) all mutate state directly, not just log. Score 4.

